        "value": "此高三萬千九百八十壹石貳斗　三ツ五分）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "この高　三万千九百八十一石二斗　三ツ五分）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "The kokudaka this levy is drawn from: 31,981 koku 2 to, taxed at three and a half tenths (0.35) in the Edo rate notation. 31,981.2 x 0.35 = 11,193.42, which is two sho short of the 11,193.44 printed in the column to its right; the gap is a rounding difference in the source, not a misreading, because every glyph in both figures is unambiguous at single-character zoom (cell 5 is 千, with the slanted top stroke, not 九). The closing parenthesis is printed here and no opening mate appears anywhere on this leaf."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "企救郡歳米此高"
      }
